                                "sense_id": "5eaaa053-85e0-3fcd-9420-4eae9256188c",
                                "text": "[D]ès qu'il se sentit hors de danger, il ne fut plus ni fatigué, ni transi, ni tremblant.",
                                "translation": "[A]s soon as he found himself out of danger, he was no longer either weary, or chilled or trembling.",
